How does modern technology change the handicraft industry?
First off, it has made a big difference in how artisans can innovate. With the introduction of new technologies, there are now many more materials available and the cost of raw materials has gone down. This gives craftsmen the freedom to experiment and try out new ideas, resulting in unique and creative products. On top of that, technology has also helped boost sales for handmade goods. A lot of traditional crafts especially those with chinese cultural elements are being sold online now. As more people discover and appreciate these unique crafts, the industry is becoming more lively and successful.

Should parents take their children to see wild animals?
There are many benefits to seeing wild animals in person. First, it can greatly enhance children's knowledge and expand their understanding. Experiencing wildlife up close is vastly different form seeing them on TV and it can spark a genuine interest in nature and the environment. Additionally, while observing wild animals, parents can instill the importance of biodiversity conservation in their children. Many species are losing their habitat due to human activities and if children learn about the significance of protecting wildlife from a very young age, they will be better equipped to care about the future of these animals.

Why are so many people keen on reading?
First off, reading different kinds of books really helps us develop our thinking and reasoning skills. For example, diving into philosophy encourages us to reflect on life and our values, while detective novels challenge us to think critically and piece together clues. These skills are incredibly valuable and can benefit us throughout our lives. Moreover, reading allows us to form our own opinions rather than simply being influenced by what others think. Everyone interprets the story in their own way. This is quite different from watching short videos, where we might just absorb someone else's perspective without questioning it.

What kind of culture is popular among the young?
The culture that young people connect with reflects what's happening in society. For Example, when the government actively supports certain cultural initiatives, those often catch on with the youth. In my country, recent efforts to promote traditional culture have sparked a lot of interest among young people in our heritage. You'll see that many prefer clothing and shoes that have classical elements in them. Additionally, modern and dynamic culture spread like the wildfire. Take rap music for instance, its fast beats, powerful lyrics, and cool dance moves attract a lot of young fans.

Do you think people of all ages need to read?
If we are discussing the intrinsic value of reading, then I believe people of all ages should engage in it, because the essence of reading goes beyond just acquiring knowledge and information.  It's also about exploring and understanding the world.  During the process, cultivating critical thinking and having an independent mindset are particularly important.  However, If we consider reading merely as a method of acquiring knowledge, then people can also learn through various other means such as audiobooks or educational vedios.  Thus, while reading holds unique importance, it is not the only option available.

Do you think only a well-known director can create the best movie?
Not at all. First of all, the storyline is really important. There are plenty of lesser-known directors who can craft innovative and meaningful plots. In today's world, audiences are looking for fresh and unique stories. As long as the story is engaging, it can definitely become a great film. Moreover, the choice of actors plays a huge role in how a movie turns out. Even an unknown director can shine if they manage to cast their right actors. When actors really get into their characters, they can take the whole film to another level.